 "note": "rack.json entries for spec/tests/js/rack-solids.mjs. fhd-cmp5dr, cmv-sfd45u5w and cmv-5u3w are copied from a build of the library (their `solids`, and the fhd-cmp5dr's `trays`), and test_rack_solids.py and test_rack_trays.py hold them to what rack_index.py derives. fhd-encl is written by hand: a closed enclosure in the shape the catalogue's `solids` take (shell walls, a patch plate, a rear grommet as a hole), which nothing in the library derives yet (step 6 of docs/cable-lay-design.md), so the kit's reading of walls and holes is tested on it."
